## Evaluation and security limits

The scenarios and telemetry are authored, deterministic synthetic data shaped like OpenTelemetry records. The regression set has 12 synthetic cases, including variants, independent authored cases, and expected-abstention cases. Dataset SHA-256:

```
65f6949e8c0c0d2f258fd65c2760591b2ff7b38fbb1edeb38cc3dc16cbac1527
```

The rules evaluation is a small synthetic regression result, not a measure of real-world incident accuracy. No OpenTelemetry Demo capture has been imported or scored. No genuine live-model request has been performed for this release. The public frontend bundle contains synthetic demo data only; model keys and database credentials are not in frontend variables.

